description:
Implement `useControlled` — a hook that bridges controlled and uncontrolled component patterns. Uses the `controlled` value when provided, otherwise manages its own internal state.

**Example:**
```tsx
// Controlled: parent drives value
const [value, setValue] = useControlled({ controlled: props.value, default: '' });
// Uncontrolled: internal state
const [value, setValue] = useControlled({ controlled: undefined, default: '' });
```

